<task id="141" project="spaarke-ontology-platform-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Child-record contract: generalise TodoRegardingBuilder over table; SignalWriter writes the regarding pair + subject lookup through it (D-133)</title>
    <phase>4c Standard child-record contract (D-131)</phase>
    <gate>blocked: 140 done (✅); #1665 and #1746 merged into docs/ontology-platform-design (both touch SignalWriter or its readers; #1747 and #1756 do not). PRIORITY: start the moment both merge — this task removes the pair-type deploy hazard (see the schema-agreement guard criterion).</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Refactor of a shared BFF builder used by To Do and Event plus the Signal writer.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Cross-cutting change to a shared component with three consumers (high blast radius).</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
